<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βούκολ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tending kine</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουκόλοι ἄνδρες, ἀγροιῶται</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.571
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.292
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. δοῦλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ion</u>
					540c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποιμὴν αἰπόλος . . καὶ β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					281
				</span></i>
			: also abs., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.110
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGoodsp.Cair.</u>
				30
			</span></i> ixI <span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλει βουκόλου πτερόεντος</span>, i.e. the gadfly, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				557
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ἵππων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					12.44
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>worshipper of Dionysos in bull-form</i>, in pl., title of play
			by Cratinus, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				203
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(9).262
			</span></i> (Eretria, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IGRom.</u>
				4.386
			</span></i> (Pergam.), <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Salt.</u>
				79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρπερέγχει</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. τοῦ Ὀσορᾶπι</span>
			<i>devotee</i> of Sarapis, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				57.7
			</span></i>. (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς</span>,
				<i>q[uglide]el-</i>, cf. Lat. <i>colo</i>: in these
			words <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωκολ-</span> is found as 
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουκολ-</span>
			 in some codd. of <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
			</span></i>)</div>
